      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KOSTECKI (8) scored by 1.75 lengths last time (18.64) in a Grade 5 over 320m at Wagga. Has already won two times from this draw. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. CHARGE THE CARD (1) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start fourth (20.25) at Gunnedah. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from seven starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. PERFECT LIAM (3) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 1.5 lengths third (19.16) behind Trixie's Chance at Temora. Has a solid record from this box including three wins and a minor placing. Expected to be in the finish again. BOY GEORGE CARGO (2) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
